{"id":"vod_sn_36542","vodId":"36542","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐OVA","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐OVA","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至OAD10","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cdddc2a5756a2e7132f64d70d6bb1c1a.jpg"},"summary":"住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/54LLgRtGiV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3sz1DLgdTk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/305LLcq8nw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mH8jBSJNZu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZchWDmRksE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u8wCYX0w6q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jxi8F5gFSg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/401j0ieYFZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hz9rYswgSA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tn2wBdhXks1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.942Z"}